 [size=18]This looks insanely intimidating, I can already sense the high inhib low IQ faggots clicking off, but don't be intimidated, it looks insanely difficult, but in my experience, it's easier than making dinner (JFL), regardless it's very simple. Basically, the premise of the ingredients are separated into 3 sections, the solvents, the absorbents, and the moisturizes. The solvent is for breaking down and dissolving the compound (we are going to be using androstanolone), the moisturizes are for causing less irritation when the liquid is applied to the skin whilst trapping moisture on the surface of the skin, and finally, the absorbents are used so the compound can actually penetrate the layer of skin, DMSO is our major absorbent, this product is very powerful and will be the main driver for the liquid concoction, The isopropyl alcohol is the solvent, we will be dissolving the androstanolone in it. The isopropyl Myristate and Isopropyl Palmitate are to enhance the penetration, and finally, the Oelic acid and Glycol are used for moisturizing the skin and trapping moisture.

